{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23155","headline":"新秋早起有怀元少尹 · 白居易","name":"新秋早起有怀元少尹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋来转觉此身衰，晨起临阶盥漱时。\n漆匣镜明头尽白，铜缾水冷齿先知。\n光阴纵惜[留难]住，官职虽荣得已迟。\n老去相逢无别计，强开笑口展愁眉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}